# Commercial S9 guide-health marker diagnosis

## Observed

The bounded S9 deployment reached the new health service, which returned
`S9_GUIDE_PAGE_RED`. The controller then disabled S9 and restored S8 green.

## Root cause

The rendered English guide contains the versioned marker
`SFW CREATOR GUIDE`, while the Control health probe compared it with the
different mixed-case byte sequence `SFW creator guide`. The German marker was
already exact.

## Resolution

Bind the health probe to the two exact versioned English and German markers.
No page content, product behavior, network boundary or disabled capability is
changed.

## Rollback

Revert this correction commit. The failed deployment already restored the
exact S8 application release and green public runtime.
